<PageTitle>Features - P1 Inventory</PageTitle><section class="public-page-head"><span class="eyebrow">FEATURES</span><h1>Everything your inventory team needs to operate clearly.</h1><p>Designed for real warehouse and purchasing workflows rather than generic CRUD screens.</p></section><section class="feature-matrix"><article><h2>Catalog</h2><p>Products, variants, categories, UOM, pricing and imports.</p></article><article><h2>Inventory</h2><p>Balances, reservations, batches, serials and expiry.</p></article><article><h2>Operations</h2><p>Stock in/out, adjustments, transfers and cycle counts.</p></article><article><h2>Purchasing</h2><p>POs, approvals, supplier performance and GRN.</p></article><article><h2>Automation</h2><p>Reorder suggestions, alerts and approval workflows.</p></article><article><h2>Security</h2><p>Roles, warehouse scopes, audit log and MFA.</p></article></section>
